    {
      "name": "a-thief-moving-in-cover-carries-the-stance-core-was-given",
      "note": "stance is an explicit carriage a caller supplies, and it is PerceptionReading.stance’s own three atoms — core states the carriage it intends and the host reports the carriage it has, so a guard’s senses and a thief’s intent are talking about the same thing.",
